Package: tenniscareers.r
Title: Visualize a Tennis Players' Career  
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Montserrat Ibarra Reyes
Description: This is a fun package that outputs a scatter plot of a tennis 
  player's matches throughout their career time. Given a valid player's first 
  and last name, one of the two functions scrapes tennisabstract.com to create 
  and clean a dataframe. Each row of the dataframe is a match they played, and 
  its columns represent the matches' date, opponent's name, opponent's date of 
  birth, and whether the player won or lost the match. The second function 
  uses this data table to create a scatter plot. Each point represents a 
  match, the x-axis is the timeline of the player's career, and the y-axis 
  is the age differnece between the player and their opponent. 
Maintainer: Montserrat Ibarra Reyes <montserrat_ibarra@berkeley.edu>
